nds to reach your hand. "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["hs","ed"],["at","It is too late. The opponents will win the Diamond "],["pg",""],["ls","ed"],["pc","da"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","es"],["at","and lead another trump "],["pg",""],["ls","es"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hs","ns"],["at","so that there are no Spades left in dummy "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["hs","sc"],["at","to trump the third Club."],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["up","19"],["hs","sc"],["nt","\nWhat could you do instead? It looks like you took your losses early by losing a Club trick, but it wasn't early enough. Instead, consider the difference if you let the opponents win the first Club trick. "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","ws"],["at","Now suppose they lead a trump "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hs","sc"],["at","to try to stop you from trumping your Club loser "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["hs","ns"],["at","in the dummy. "],["pg",""],["nt","\nYou have to win in the dummy, "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hc","ca"],["at","but you can get back to your hand with the carefully preserved @CA. "],["pg",""],["lc","ca"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","ca"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","sc"],["at","Then you can lead your last Club "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["hs","ns"],["at","and trump it in the dummy. "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["pc","s"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["at","The opponents can no longer stop you from making your contract."],["pg",""],["nt","\nBy taking your losses very early, you kept a vital entry to your hand until you were ready to play it."],["",""]]}}